{
    "title": "TV Remote Control for RokuTV",
    "description": "Do you need a free remote for RokuTV? \r\nDo you want to open your Roku channels and apps in a few seconds from your Android Phone or Tablet?\r\nRemote Control for RokuTV app will help you easily control your media player. You will be able to control the playback of your content, run applications on Roku and enter text. \r\n\r\nRemote Control for RokuTV is the best Roku remote control app for Streaming Player and RokuTV. \r\n \r\n\ud83d\udcfaThanks to this RokuTV Remote app, access to movies, music and games will become simpler and easier, and you will love your Roku even more. All you need is to connect your Android device and RokuTV to the same Wi-Fi network.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcfaRemote for RokuTV makes it easy to operate your TVs. This Smart TV - Remote Control for RokuTV app also helps you use swipe-based gestures on your devices for easier navigation. The best method for watching, casting to TV, and playing games on TV is with the RokuTV Remote app.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcfaYou will be able to adjust the volume of your RokuTV and switch channels. The app allows for automated media player connection. After a brief connecting process, you can use this smart remote control for the Roku app to manage TV channels, change volume, type text, mirror the screen, and cast videos to RokuTVs. Now your Roku remote is ready to work right after launching.\r\n\r\n\u2753 How to connect to TV:\r\n1. Your RokuTV must be connected to your home's wifi network.\r\n2. Your Android phone's WiFi must be turned on and connected to the same network as the RokuTV.\r\n3. Launch this Roku Remote app and tap to select the target Roku device to connect. Once connected, you can control your Roku devices as you wish.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2 Free features:\r\n\u2022 Remote control for RokuTV\r\n\u2022 Play/pause, fast forward, rewind\r\n\u2022 Pair with multiple Roku devices\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2Key Features:\r\n\u2022 No setup is required. Remote app automatically scans your local network to find your Roku TV.\r\n\u2022 Keyboard feature helps you to enter text and search on your Roku device more easily.\r\n\u2022 Touch Pad Navigation allows you easily navigate like a real remote stick.\r\n\u2022 Manage TV channels and apps with this TV remote app, easily launch channels with one tap.\r\n\u2022 Mirror your phone/tablet screen to Roku TV.\r\n\u2022 Cast local photos or videos from smartphone gallery to Roku TV screen.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2 Why you should choose Remote Control for RokuTV:\r\n- This Roku remote tv control app makes your Roku Exprience even Better\r\n- Compatible with all Roku TVs including TCL, Sharp, Insignia, Hitachi;\r\n- Roku remote controls; \r\n- Automatic connection to Roku; \r\n- Handy list of apps with large icons; \r\n- Adjusting the volume and switching TV channels on Roku TV; \r\n- Write text on your TV from you phone!\r\n- Using the touchpad or buttons to navigate;\r\n- Control of content playback;\r\n- Simple and user-friendly interface;\r\n- Wear OS;\r\n\r\nWith RokuTV Remote, we wanted everyone to have the best Roku remote app so we made the Roku remote control functionality free.\r\n\r\nCompatibility:\r\n- Roku Remote Control is compatible with all Roku models including Streaming Stick, Express, Express+, Premiere, Premiere+, Ultra, Roku TV (TCL, Sharp, Insignia, Hisense, RCA, Hitachi)\r\n\r\n\u203b If you like this Roku remote tv control app, then please give us a good rating as the driving force behind our continued development, thank you.\r\n\u203b Download the Remote Control for RokuTV App to get the most amazing experience ever!\u2764\ufe0f\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nBegamob is not an affiliated entity of Roku, Inc, and Remote Control for RokuTV application is not an official product of Roku, Inc.",
